@levorn_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5019

### Health Check
GET {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Customers
GET {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Customer
POST {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Ahmet",
    "lastName": "Yılmaz",
    "phone": "05551112233",
    "email": "ahmet@example.com",
    "notes": "Test müşterisi"
}

###

### Create Appointment
POST {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 2,
    "startTime": "2026-09-15T14:30:00",
    "endTime": "2026-09-15T15:00:00",
    "status": "Pending",
    "notes": "Saç kesimi"
}

###

### Get All Appointments
GET {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Appointment By Id
GET {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Appointment - Conflict Test
PUT {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 2,
    "startTime": "2026-09-15T14:45:00",
    "endTime": "2026-09-15T15:15:00",
    "status": "Confirmed",
    "notes": "PUT çakışma testi"
}

###

### Delete Appointment
DELETE {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/1

###

### Verify Deleted Appointment
GET {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/1

###

### Create Base Appointment For Conflict Test
POST {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 2,
    "startTime": "2026-09-15T14:30:00",
    "endTime": "2026-09-15T15:00:00",
    "status": "Pending",
    "notes": "Çakışma ana randevusu"
}

###

### Appointment Conflict Test
POST {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 2,
    "startTime": "2026-09-15T14:45:00",
    "endTime": "2026-09-15T15:15:00",
    "status": "Pending",
    "notes": "Çakışma testi"
}

###

### Invalid Time Test
POST {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 2,
    "startTime": "2026-09-15T15:00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-09-15T14:30:00",
    "status": "Pending",
    "notes": "Geçersiz saat testi"
}
### Create Second Appointment For PUT Conflict Test
POST {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 2,
    "startTime": "2026-09-15T16:00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-09-15T17:00:00",
    "status": "Pending",
    "notes": "PUT conflict ana randevusu"
}
### FINAL PUT CONFLICT TEST
PUT {{levorn_api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 2,
    "startTime": "2026-09-15T16:30:00",
    "endTime": "2026-09-15T17:30:00",
    "status": "Confirmed",
    "notes": "FINAL PUT CONFLICT TEST"
}
### Update Appointment
